{
  "endpoint": "https://inference.do-ai.run/v1/chat/completions",
  "timeout_s": 1500,
  "max_retries": 2,
  "_notes": [
    "timeout_s raised from 600 to 1500 on 28 July: phase A max latencies clustered at 570-599s, i.e. calls were being cut off AT the 600s ceiling. The 89 excluded calls were almost certainly timeouts, and the reported max latencies are censored at the old timeout.",
    "kind=single  -> plain chat completion, no model_synthesis tool.",
    "kind=synthesis -> adds the model_synthesis tool object.",
    "preset (budget|balanced|quality) replaces analysis_models, judge and reasoning_effort -- do not send both.",
    "tool_choice 'required' forces the server-side tool to run instead of letting",
    "the model decide. Documented for server-side tools on this endpoint. If a",
    "synthesis arm still returns no panel/judge usage block, tool_choice is not",
    "being honoured for model_synthesis and that is itself a finding.",
    "extra_tools = additional tool objects appended to the tools array (web_search).",
    "WEB SEARCH IS BILLED $10 PER 1000 REQUESTS, separate from tokens. With N panel",
    "models each allowed max_uses searches, worst case is N*max_uses charges per call.",
    "temperature is deliberately never sent. Default is used everywhere."
  ],
  "configs": [
    {
      "id": "single_glm_low",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "reasoning_effort": "low",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false
    },
    {
      "id": "single_glm_high",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 3,
      "latency": true
    },
    {
      "id": "single_kimi_low",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "kimi-k2.6",
      "reasoning_effort": "low",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false
    },
    {
      "id": "single_kimi_high",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "kimi-k2.6",
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false
    },
    {
      "id": "single_qwen_high",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false
    },
    {
      "id": "single_deepseek_high",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "deepseek-4-flash",
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false
    },
    {
      "id": "single_frontier_high",
      "kind": "single",
      "model": "openai-gpt-5.6-sol",
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 3,
      "latency": true,
      "_note": "Frontier single-model baseline. The published claim is that open panels beat GPT-5.6 on quality; this is the arm that lets the article speak to it."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_heavy2",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "kimi-k2.6"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 3,
      "latency": true,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "_note": "THE PUBLISHED CONFIGURATION: GLM-5.2 + Kimi K2.6, GLM as synthesizer."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_open2_plus_frontier",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "kimi-k2.6",
        "openai-gpt-5.6-sol"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "_note": "Does adding a frontier model to the published open panel change the answer?"
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_frontier_judge",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "openai-gpt-5.6-sol",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "kimi-k2.6"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "judge_on_panel": false,
      "_note": "Same panel as the published config, stronger judge. The judge is the ceiling of the system -- it can only pick from what the panel produced."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_preset_budget",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "preset": "budget",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "enabled": true,
      "_note": "Smallest panel, lightest reasoning. The floor of the preset dial. role_usage will reveal what this preset actually contains."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_preset_balanced",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "preset": "balanced",
      "reps": 3,
      "latency": true,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "enabled": true,
      "_note": "Mid-size panel, moderate depth. The likeliest default in real use. role_usage will reveal what this preset actually contains."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_preset_quality",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "preset": "quality",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required",
      "enabled": true,
      "_note": "Largest panel, deepest reasoning. The ceiling, and the expensive one. role_usage will reveal what this preset actually contains."
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_all4",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "kimi-k2.6",
        "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
        "deepseek-4-flash"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 3,
      "latency": true,
      "tool_choice": "required"
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_light2",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
        "deepseek-4-flash"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required"
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_all4_low",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "kimi-k2.6",
        "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
        "deepseek-4-flash"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "low",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "tool_choice": "required"
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_judge_on",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "glm-5.2",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
        "deepseek-4-flash"
      ],
      "reasoning_effort": "high",
      "reps": 1,
      "latency": false,
      "judge_on_panel": true,
      "tool_choice": "required"
    },
    {
      "id": "synth_judge_off",
      "kind": "synthesis",
      "model": "glm-5.2",
      "judge": "kimi-k2.6",
      "analysis_models": [
        "glm-5.2",
        "alibaba-qwen3-32b",
